## 2. Core Architecture

Create one shared Audit Framework used by all independent applications.

```text
                  Common Audit Framework
                           |
          +----------------+----------------+
          |                |                |
          v                v                v
   Quarantine API    Restoration API    Other API
          |                |                |
          +----------------+----------------+
                           |
                           v
                 Standard Audit Event
                           |
                           v
                 Central Audit Pipeline
                           |
                           v
                    Splunk / Audit Store
```

Business applications remain independent, but their audit contract is centralized and identical.

---

## 3. Separate Business Actions From Audit Information

Business actions may include:

```text
QUARANTINE
RESTORE
DELETE
RETRY
REPROCESS
UPDATE
```

Audit information includes:

```text
Who performed it
What record was affected
What action occurred
Previous state
New state
Success/failure
Failure reason
Timestamp
Application
Environment
Workflow/request information
Correlation information
```

The shared framework owns the audit contract. Applications provide contextual business information.

