## 6. Record-Level Auditing

The system may process one record or millions of records.

For bulk operations:

```text
Operation
 |
 +-- Record 001 -> Audit Event
 +-- Record 002 -> Audit Event
 +-- Record 003 -> Audit Event
 +-- ...
```

There must be one logical audit event per affected record.

Also support `operationId` so all records belonging to one operation can be correlated.

Do not create only one event saying "500 records processed" because record-level traceability is required.

