## 7. Correlation and Traceability

Support:

```text
Next.js UI
   |
.NET API
   |
Step Functions
   |
POST API
   |
DynamoDB
   |
Audit Framework
   |
Splunk
```

Use these identifiers consistently:

- `correlationId` — distributed request tracing.
- `operationId` — business operation/batch.
- `recordId` — individual record.
- `workflowExecutionId` — Step Functions execution.
- `eventId` — individual audit event.

Document when each identifier is generated and propagated.

